OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fand clear this evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith temperatures quickly falling away
OL,8,Fto give another widespread frost. Cold
OL,9,Fwith light winds and a few mist and
OL,10,Ffreezing fog patches.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FAnother cold, frosty and
OL,13,Fbright start to Saturday. Patchy cloud
OL,14,Finto the afternoon but remaining dry
OL,15,Fwith plenty of sunny spells. A breeze
OL,16,Fpicking up during the evening. Frost
OL,17,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
