OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,6,Fwill be wet and windy for many, with a
OL,7,Fdrier interlude on Monday, before more
OL,8,Fpersistent rain arrives overnight into
OL,9,FTuesday. Temperatures close to or just
OL,10,Fbelow the average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
